#: ../../entities/government-huangpu.rst:1
msgid "Huangpu science and entrepreneurship services"
msgstr "黄浦区科技与创业服务部门"

#: ../../entities/government-huangpu.rst:4
msgid "黄浦区科技与创业服务部门"
msgstr "黄浦区科技与创业服务部门"

#: ../../entities/government-huangpu.rst:6
msgid "Government | Huangpu | Research checked 2026-11-04"
msgstr "政府部门｜黄浦区｜研究核对日期 2026-11-04"

#: ../../entities/government-huangpu.rst:8
msgid ""
"The 2025-2026 Zhangjiang Huangpu Park plan emphasizes fintech and "
"clinical research services. Huangpu ChuangKa is a separate youth "
"entrepreneurship support route; check eligibility and current workstation "
"availability."
msgstr "2025至2026年张江黄浦园方案侧重金融科技与临床研究服务。黄浦创卡是另行实施的青年创业支持渠道，须核验资格与当前工位情况。"

#: ../../entities/government-huangpu.rst:10

#| msgid ""
#| "`Evidence S100 "
#| "<https://www.shanghai.gov.cn/tszczq-qtqj2/20250928/01633cced4e24e7b95ef1fa870b2aacd.html>`_. "
#| "黄浦区人民政府关于印发《张江高新区黄浦园改革创新发展行动方案（2025-2026年）》的通知."
msgid ""
"`Evidence S103 "
"<https://www.shanghai.gov.cn/tszczq-qtqj2/20250928/01633cced4e24e7b95ef1fa870b2aacd.html>`_. "
"黄浦区人民政府关于印发《张江高新区黄浦园改革创新发展行动方案（2025-2026年）》的通知."
msgstr "`证据 S103 <https://www.shanghai.gov.cn/tszczq-qtqj2/20250928/01633cced4e24e7b95ef1fa870b2aacd.html>`_. 黄浦区人民政府关于印发《张江高新区黄浦园改革创新发展行动方案（2025-2026年）》的通知."

#: ../../entities/government-huangpu.rst:12
msgid "Status and support"
msgstr "状态与支持"

#: ../../entities/government-huangpu.rst:15
msgid "Published entity; intake to confirm"
msgstr "机构有来源，招募待确认"

#: ../../entities/government-huangpu.rst:17
msgid ""
"No standard cash award, fee waiver or equity percentage is verified for "
"this entry. Request the current written offer."
msgstr "本条未核实统一现金资助、免费权益或股权比例，请索取现行书面方案。"

#: ../../entities/government-huangpu.rst:19
msgid "Contact and location"
msgstr "联系与位置"

#: ../../entities/government-huangpu.rst:22
msgid "`Official website / intake route <https://www.shhuangpu.gov.cn/>`_"
msgstr "`官网／对接入口 <https://www.shhuangpu.gov.cn/>`_"

#: ../../entities/government-huangpu.rst:24
msgid ""
"Use the official website to request the responsible team and current "
"application route. Email addresses are not reproduced in this publication."
msgstr "请通过官网联系负责团队，确认现行申请渠道。本刊不刊载邮箱地址。"

#: ../../entities/government-huangpu.rst:26
msgid ""
"Map position uses a district or campus anchor; it is not a verified "
"office location."
msgstr "地图位置使用区级或校区锚点，并非核实后的办公室位置。"

#: ../../entities/government-huangpu.rst:28
msgid "Application workflow"
msgstr "申请流程"

#: ../../entities/government-huangpu.rst:31
msgid ""
"Editorial application checklist. The current official notice or agreement "
"controls the actual procedure."
msgstr "编辑申请清单，实际流程以现行官方通知或协议为准。"

#: ../../entities/government-huangpu.rst:33
msgid ""
"Read the dated call and verify district, entity, activity and "
"spending-period rules."
msgstr "阅读带日期通知，核验属地、主体、业务及支出期间。"

#: ../../entities/government-huangpu.rst:35
msgid ""
"Prepare the prescribed pack and complete host or district endorsement if "
"required."
msgstr "准备规定材料，按要求完成单位或区级推荐。"

#: ../../entities/government-huangpu.rst:37
msgid ""
"Submit through the official platform before the stated deadline and keep "
"the receipt."
msgstr "在截止前通过官方平台提交并保存回执。"

#: ../../entities/government-huangpu.rst:39
msgid ""
"Follow review, award, reporting, acceptance and payment obligations in "
"the notice."
msgstr "遵循通知中的评审、立项、报告、验收及拨付义务。"

#: ../../entities/government-huangpu.rst:41
msgid ":doc:`Huangpu district route </districts/huangpu>`"
msgstr ":doc:`黄浦区对接路径 </districts/huangpu>`"

